Notes for new Carpentries courses:

1. Copy over contents from existing repo
  1.1 Make sure to copy ".github" file to ensure that
      page builds as required.
2. Make `gh-pages` branch
  2.1 The repo needs both `gh-branch` and `main`!
3. On the github repo page, go to "Settings" -> "Pages"
  3.1 Make sure that the page is being pulled from 
    `gh-pages`, not from `main`


